WEBVTT

00:00:09.950 --> 00:00:15.120
I thought those guys with friends and girlfriends
had nothing at all to worry about.

00:00:15.950 --> 00:00:20.450
Especially when it came to girlfriends,
I thought the goal was to just get one,

00:00:20.450 --> 00:00:24.080
and I couldn't imagine everything that came after that.

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:30.330
There you are...

00:00:32.950 --> 00:00:34.080
Are you okay?

00:00:34.750 --> 00:00:37.450
I'm sorry, everything that happened is my fault.

00:00:37.830 --> 00:00:38.620
Huh?

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:43.750
I don't know the reason,
but it's my fault things are like this, right?

00:00:44.080 --> 00:00:47.750
Huh? Uh... Yeah, that's right.

00:00:48.700 --> 00:00:52.790
I'm really sorry. I'm as awful as always...

00:00:56.660 --> 00:01:00.580
Hey! Do all that when we get back! It's freezing!

00:01:00.580 --> 00:01:01.870
M-my bad.

00:01:06.160 --> 00:01:08.040
Igarashi, are you alright?!

00:01:08.330 --> 00:01:10.790
I-I'm sorry. Well...

00:01:10.790 --> 00:01:14.040
She went to gather some wild vegetables and got lost.

00:01:14.250 --> 00:01:17.450
W-wild vegetables, huh? I see! If that's the case, it's okay!

00:01:17.450 --> 00:01:19.500
You're pretty troublesome, huh, Igarashi?

00:01:19.500 --> 00:01:21.790
Alright, guys, get inside, get inside...

00:01:22.200 --> 00:01:25.500
U-Um... I...

00:01:28.620 --> 00:01:32.250
It's okay. I really was just gathering
some wild vegetables.

00:01:38.830 --> 00:01:42.000
Ayado, you have a fever, so hurry up and go to sleep!

00:01:42.870 --> 00:01:44.620
This is not good! Hey!

00:01:44.910 --> 00:01:48.250
You're going to the hospital
first thing in the morning! Jeez!

00:01:49.410 --> 00:01:53.040
Ichiban daijin a koto wa
The most important thing

00:01:53.540 --> 00:01:57.160
Daremo shiranai koto nanda
Is something nobody knows

00:01:57.500 --> 00:02:01.250
Are mo kore mo daijina you de
Things which may be considered important

00:02:01.410 --> 00:02:04.790
Toki ga sugireba kiete yuku
May fade away as time goes by

00:02:04.870 --> 00:02:12.580
Kaze ni notte kumo no kirema ni
Romance in pale pink

00:02:12.950 --> 00:02:18.950
Tadayou no wa omoide no you na
Like the palm of a hand which has begun to color

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:28.330
Irozuki hajimeta te no hira no you na
Riding on the wind

00:02:28.790 --> 00:02:35.000
Usubeni iro no koigokoro
Just like memories drifting in the break in the clouds

00:02:36.870 --> 00:02:40.330
Toki wo kakenuke yagate kuru
The new season will come soon

00:02:40.500 --> 00:02:46.290
Atarashii kisetsu yume to wa sukoshi chigau
Leaping through time

00:02:46.290 --> 00:02:49.790
Tada oboeteiru koto wa
And it's little different from a dream

00:02:49.790 --> 00:02:55.700
Daijina koto nanda
But the things I remember are very important

00:02:57.540 --> 00:03:01.410
Ichiban daijina kotoba
The most important words

00:03:01.410 --> 00:03:05.500
Daremo iwazuni owarisou
May never be said to anybody

00:03:05.500 --> 00:03:09.500
Are mo kore mo daijoubu sa
Everything will be all right

00:03:09.500 --> 00:03:13.450
Toki ga sugitemo oboeteru
Even though time passes, I will remember

00:03:13.450 --> 00:03:17.330
Anata no koto wa oboeteru
I will remember you

00:03:20.200 --> 00:03:23.910
About Our Mutual Misunderstandings

00:03:23.040 --> 00:03:26.080
I'm sorry that somehow things are always like this.

00:03:26.410 --> 00:03:29.870
And I'm sorry I don't understand the things
that a normal person would.

00:03:30.830 --> 00:03:33.200
I want to make up. How do we do that?

00:03:34.080 --> 00:03:36.750
No, I'm sorry, too.

00:03:37.250 --> 00:03:38.160
No...

00:03:38.870 --> 00:03:45.080
I was thinking about this by myself earlier,
but I think this was definitely my fault.

00:03:45.290 --> 00:03:47.000
Wh-why do you think that?

00:03:47.290 --> 00:03:52.830
Tsutsun, when you're kind to other people I don't like it.

00:03:53.160 --> 00:03:57.000
I can't hate that you're kind to others, right?

00:03:57.950 --> 00:04:02.000
I didn't want to say that sort of thing. I hate myself.

00:04:02.000 --> 00:04:05.660
W-wait a minute! Gimme some time to load!

00:04:09.540 --> 00:04:10.700
I get it.

00:04:10.700 --> 00:04:11.750
What do you get?!

00:04:12.250 --> 00:04:17.540
I get that if you think about it any more than this,
you probably won't understand.

00:04:19.040 --> 00:04:21.080
Things haven't been going well lately...

00:04:21.830 --> 00:04:25.580
If you don't understand,
then I'll think about what we should do.

00:04:28.540 --> 00:04:31.870
What? What's she gonna think about?

00:04:34.250 --> 00:04:38.370
How did things get to this?

00:04:38.700 --> 00:04:43.750
Well, it's not like it matters.
I'm glad that at least the cottage got cleaned.

00:04:44.660 --> 00:04:46.950
But you sure seem worried for someone who says that.

00:04:47.290 --> 00:04:48.250
Not really!

00:04:48.250 --> 00:04:51.910
What is up with everyone?!
All busy with romance and stuff...

00:04:51.910 --> 00:04:53.450
It's 'cause you're lonely, isn't it?

00:04:54.250 --> 00:04:58.830
Lately, Tstusui and Igarashi
have been getting weird pretty often.

00:04:59.120 --> 00:05:01.950
I've been hoping that things would improve.

00:05:02.200 --> 00:05:05.250
You're doing your best
for other people's love lives, you know?

00:05:05.830 --> 00:05:09.370
Why am I doing that?! This isn't even the right time
to be worried about other people!

00:05:10.160 --> 00:05:12.660
You're a good person, Ishino.

00:05:13.330 --> 00:05:14.330
Then will you date me?

00:05:14.330 --> 00:05:15.290
I will not.

00:05:15.290 --> 00:05:16.330
That was fast...

00:05:17.370 --> 00:05:18.540
You gotta tell me!

00:05:18.540 --> 00:05:24.040
Me being nice to people...
Is there something that's unfair to her about that?!

00:05:24.040 --> 00:05:25.000
Huh?

00:05:25.160 --> 00:05:28.250
Uh... Try to think about it normally.

00:05:28.250 --> 00:05:33.290
If you're that indiscriminately nice to people,
will you take responsibility if someone starts to like you?

00:05:33.290 --> 00:05:36.250
There's no way any girl but her would ever like me!

00:05:36.540 --> 00:05:38.750
That's not what I'm asking!

00:05:38.750 --> 00:05:42.000
I'm asking if there's any actual harm done by that!

00:05:42.620 --> 00:05:48.330
Okay, if Igarashi was kind to other people,
what would you think? Wouldn't you be jealous?

00:05:51.120 --> 00:05:52.330
Probably not.

00:05:52.500 --> 00:05:53.450
Are you serious?

00:05:53.450 --> 00:05:56.040
So you wouldn't think anything of it at the time?

00:05:56.620 --> 00:06:01.870
I might get sad... But I always thought
that it was strange that she was dating me,

00:06:01.870 --> 00:06:04.950
and I think she wouldn't feel like that either.

00:06:06.250 --> 00:06:09.250
Our common sense just does not apply here.

00:06:09.250 --> 00:06:12.500
Just go ahead and fail. You're not cut out for this.

00:06:12.500 --> 00:06:13.500
Hey!

00:06:18.040 --> 00:06:19.200
Ayado!

00:06:19.790 --> 00:06:21.250
Ito-senpai...

00:06:22.160 --> 00:06:23.500
I'm sorry.

00:06:23.500 --> 00:06:28.950
I said goodbye to Ishino-senpai.
I'm going to leave now and go to the hospital.

00:06:29.500 --> 00:06:32.410
It looks like you're still having a hard time... I'm going too.

00:06:32.830 --> 00:06:33.790
Huh?

00:06:34.410 --> 00:06:37.000
Izuri Station

00:06:43.830 --> 00:06:46.790
I bought some mikan at the station earlier. Have one.

00:06:46.790 --> 00:06:49.790
You don't have to worry about me right now.

00:06:52.200 --> 00:06:57.620
I'll be with you along the way too, so don't worry.
And if you feel any worse let me know right away.

00:06:59.370 --> 00:07:01.000
Thank you.

00:07:01.500 --> 00:07:04.950
I've ruined our much-anticipated camping trip.

00:07:06.120 --> 00:07:09.950
Maybe from now on, I'll feel down due to regret.

00:07:10.620 --> 00:07:14.330
That's why you being here with me right now really helps.

00:07:15.950 --> 00:07:17.500
I'm the worst, aren't I?

00:07:18.040 --> 00:07:21.290
I selfishly disturbed those two and now I'm leaving.

00:07:21.950 --> 00:07:28.250
It's obvious to even me that they will break up...
and so I think they should.

00:07:28.870 --> 00:07:32.290
I'm going to confess to Tsutsui-senpai.

00:07:36.830 --> 00:07:40.200
It seems like she's finally run out of patience with me.

00:07:40.750 --> 00:07:44.080
Why won't everything go well just by liking each other?

00:07:44.750 --> 00:07:49.200
And why do I suck so much as a human?

00:07:51.580 --> 00:07:54.000
Hikari, your drawing is good!

00:07:55.540 --> 00:07:57.040
I-Is it?

00:07:57.330 --> 00:08:02.620
That's Magical Melon, right?
I love her too! Draw some more!

00:08:03.950 --> 00:08:05.540
I'm so happy!

00:08:05.750 --> 00:08:08.120
Draw Bamboo Shoot Tsuntsun next!

00:08:08.120 --> 00:08:09.250
O-okay.

00:08:09.700 --> 00:08:11.540
You guys sure are close!

00:08:11.540 --> 00:08:14.000
Tsutsui and Julia sittin' in a tree...

00:08:14.000 --> 00:08:15.580
That isn't true!

00:08:15.580 --> 00:08:18.580
Hikari's really good at drawing!

00:08:18.580 --> 00:08:19.870
Oh, it's true!

00:08:19.870 --> 00:08:23.120
But you only draw girls! Draw a robot!

00:08:25.160 --> 00:08:27.450
Whoa, Tsutsui! You're amazing!

00:08:30.370 --> 00:08:33.040
Why are you still drawing those things in middle school?

00:08:33.160 --> 00:08:34.620
Eww, gross!

00:08:34.620 --> 00:08:36.040
That's him, right?

00:08:36.040 --> 00:08:38.040
They say he's a huge otaku!

00:08:38.040 --> 00:08:40.620
Julia, you went to the same
elementary school, didn't you?

00:08:40.830 --> 00:08:45.080
Uh, yeah... but I didn't really talk to him.

00:08:49.950 --> 00:08:51.290
Whoa, sorry!

00:08:52.580 --> 00:08:54.620
I thought I had sealed that away...

00:08:56.120 --> 00:09:00.250
So my current situation truly is a miracle,
no matter how I think about it.

00:09:00.700 --> 00:09:05.080
And if I make her cry, I'm definitely going
to incur some unthinkable divine punishment.

00:09:06.080 --> 00:09:09.290
I'm going to find her
and talk to her properly at school tomorrow.

00:09:09.330 --> 00:09:15.120
I can't give up
even if I don't understand...
even if I have
no communication skills.

00:09:10.000 --> 00:09:14.450
I can't give up, even if I don't understand...
even if I have no communication skills.

00:09:20.830 --> 00:09:22.620
I don't want to talk right now.

00:09:22.750 --> 00:09:27.120
W-wait. If we don't talk, then things won't change, right?

00:09:27.450 --> 00:09:29.330
They won't change even if do we talk.

00:09:29.830 --> 00:09:31.660
U-um...

00:09:31.830 --> 00:09:34.040
Then I'll just go ahead and tell you this.

00:09:34.620 --> 00:09:38.160
U-up until now I've never said this, but...

00:09:38.370 --> 00:09:41.200
I... I really do...

00:09:43.370 --> 00:09:44.870
What do I do?!

00:09:45.540 --> 00:09:46.870
Before bed last night,

00:09:46.870 --> 00:09:51.620
I thought I could express my feelings because
I was so pumped that I had come up with something,

00:09:51.910 --> 00:09:53.330
but I can't say it!

00:09:53.330 --> 00:09:56.500
Can I say... that I love her?

00:09:56.950 --> 00:09:59.910
I've never said that...

00:09:56.950 --> 00:09:59.910
to anyone up to now.

00:09:56.960 --> 00:09:59.830
I've never said it to anyone up to now!

00:10:01.080 --> 00:10:02.700
My stomach hurts now!

00:10:04.830 --> 00:10:07.000
A text! W-wait a second.

00:10:07.620 --> 00:10:08.750
It's from Ayado.

00:10:09.750 --> 00:10:11.120
You know her number?

00:10:11.410 --> 00:10:16.660
Yeah. Back when we were really in to talking
about anime we exchanged images with each other.

00:10:17.120 --> 00:10:19.910
It looks like there's something
I've gotta do, so I'll be right back!

00:10:20.290 --> 00:10:21.250
Huh?

00:10:31.160 --> 00:10:33.790
Ayado, nice timing!

00:10:41.830 --> 00:10:45.580
Uh... Sorry. Can you say that one more time?

00:10:46.160 --> 00:10:47.450
I'm saying...

00:10:47.870 --> 00:10:49.910
I-I love Senpai.

00:10:50.620 --> 00:10:51.620
Who?

00:10:53.370 --> 00:10:54.790
You, Tsusui-senpai!

00:11:02.450 --> 00:11:05.540
10 Minutes Earlier

00:11:04.620 --> 00:11:08.370
Ayado, sorry I kept you waiting. Did something happen?

00:11:08.370 --> 00:11:10.370
Uh... Um...

00:11:10.370 --> 00:11:11.870
By the way, how's your cold?

00:11:11.870 --> 00:11:13.330
Oh, well it's...

00:11:13.330 --> 00:11:14.330
Are you okay?

00:11:14.330 --> 00:11:17.330
Yes, I'm completely recovered.

00:11:17.700 --> 00:11:19.040
Thank you so much.

00:11:19.040 --> 00:11:20.410
That's great.

00:11:20.870 --> 00:11:22.040
Yeah...

00:11:22.450 --> 00:11:25.910
H-huh? Ayado, wasn't there something you needed?

00:11:25.910 --> 00:11:29.290
Uh, yes! That's right, I did!

00:11:30.830 --> 00:11:32.830
Please wait a moment.

00:11:34.450 --> 00:11:38.910
Um... I'm sorry that I made a mess of our camping trip.

00:11:39.250 --> 00:11:43.040
If you're talking about your cold, it's not a problem.
If anything, that's Ishino's fault.

00:11:43.040 --> 00:11:45.870
Not that! I'm talking about Igarashi!

00:11:46.790 --> 00:11:49.620
The reason why Igarashi-senpai
was acting strange that time...

00:11:49.620 --> 00:11:51.540
Do you know something, Ayado?

00:11:51.910 --> 00:11:55.790
Honestly, right now things have been
feeling a bit uncomfortable with her,

00:11:56.120 --> 00:11:58.000
so if you know, please tell m-

00:11:58.000 --> 00:11:59.410
It's my fault!

00:12:00.910 --> 00:12:04.080
It's because... I love Senpai.

00:12:04.950 --> 00:12:08.870
I confessed that to Igarashi-senpai.

00:12:08.870 --> 00:12:11.250
When I think about it now, I don't know why I told her.

00:12:11.250 --> 00:12:14.250
Er... "love"? Love as in...

00:12:14.790 --> 00:12:16.000
Yuri?!

00:12:17.080 --> 00:12:20.580
U-um... Sorry. Can you say that one more time?

00:12:20.580 --> 00:12:23.200
Huh? I said, I love Senpai.

00:12:23.200 --> 00:12:24.080
Who?

00:12:24.080 --> 00:12:25.450
Tsutsui-senpai!

00:12:31.830 --> 00:12:35.290
Where is it? What did I mishear?

00:12:31.910 --> 00:12:33.410
Where is it?

00:12:35.830 --> 00:12:37.660
Think about this calmly!

00:12:37.660 --> 00:12:44.410
Who is Tsutsui-senpai? And what's this "love" thing
again? Or is it "Luv"? Or "Luff"...Lufengosaurus?!

00:12:44.410 --> 00:12:46.040
N-no, that isn't it!

00:12:46.870 --> 00:12:47.750
Senpai?

00:12:47.750 --> 00:12:48.580
Huh?!

00:12:48.870 --> 00:12:52.750
I'm sorry... I don't mean to cause you trouble.

00:12:53.790 --> 00:13:00.500
I was hoping that a proper break up could ease
the ill feelings between you two at least a little.

00:13:12.660 --> 00:13:13.660
Huh?

00:13:21.870 --> 00:13:25.910
Crap... The capacity overload
was so intense I ran away...

00:13:26.850 --> 00:13:28.150
I
love
Senpai

00:13:26.910 --> 00:13:28.120
I love you, Senpai!

00:13:28.120 --> 00:13:30.750
Will you take RESPONSIBILITY
if someone starts to like you?

00:13:28.150 --> 00:13:30.600
Will you take responsibility
if someone starts to like you?

00:13:30.600 --> 00:13:32.450
Tsutsun, when you're kind
to other people...

00:13:30.750 --> 00:13:33.290
Tsutsun, when you're kind to other people I don't like it.

00:13:32.450 --> 00:13:33.450
I
don't
like
it

00:13:33.290 --> 00:13:35.790
There's no way any girl but her would ever like me!

00:13:33.450 --> 00:13:35.750
There's no way any girl but her would ever like me!

00:13:35.750 --> 00:13:37.620
It's your fault
things are like this

00:13:35.790 --> 00:13:38.540
It's your fault things are like this! You idiot!

00:13:37.430 --> 00:13:38.370
Idiot!

00:13:39.370 --> 00:13:44.410
I'm a huge idiot... For real,
I really am... Guys like me are...

00:13:45.500 --> 00:13:47.040
I didn't even think about it.

00:13:47.410 --> 00:13:49.040
Me being loved by someone...

00:13:50.160 --> 00:13:53.660
And she knew about Ayado's feelings.

00:13:54.870 --> 00:13:58.950
I don't understand the reason,
but it's my fault that things are like this.

00:13:59.370 --> 00:14:01.700
I want to make up. How do we do that?

00:14:02.160 --> 00:14:03.830
Idiot, idiot, idiot!

00:14:04.160 --> 00:14:07.410
But she can't say something like that herself, right?!

00:14:07.700 --> 00:14:10.540
Even so, what am I saying?!

00:14:10.950 --> 00:14:11.700
Tsutsui?

00:14:13.160 --> 00:14:14.660
What are you doing?

00:14:15.370 --> 00:14:17.080
Uh... nothing...

00:14:17.580 --> 00:14:19.750
Did... something happen?

00:14:22.080 --> 00:14:24.950
Oh, if you don't want to tell me, that's fine, though.

00:14:26.000 --> 00:14:27.450
Ito, I'm sorry.

00:14:31.120 --> 00:14:33.910
I'm more insensitive than I am dense, huh?

00:14:34.620 --> 00:14:37.870
I've probably unintentionally
been that way with you too, Ito.

00:14:38.660 --> 00:14:40.660
You haven't, though...

00:14:41.160 --> 00:14:44.200
Thanks for being friends with me.

00:14:46.200 --> 00:14:48.120
Did Ayado confess to you?

00:14:49.040 --> 00:14:51.250
Wh-why-why?! Do you have ESP?!

00:14:51.250 --> 00:14:54.120
Do you just KNOW that sort of thing
if we've been friends for a long time?!

00:14:54.290 --> 00:14:57.370
No... I heard it from Ayado herself.

00:14:59.790 --> 00:15:02.120
Well... I wonder what I should do.

00:15:02.750 --> 00:15:05.450
Even though it was my fault
that all these things happened,

00:15:05.450 --> 00:15:10.910
I didn't know that I had a vital role in it,
and when I finally realized it, I hurt her.

00:15:11.620 --> 00:15:14.700
Maybe now, I'll hurt Ayado, too.

00:15:16.330 --> 00:15:21.120
Even though she loves me as I am, I hurt her as I am.

00:15:21.120 --> 00:15:24.830
This is unbearable. I don't know what to do.

00:15:26.330 --> 00:15:27.870
You didn't reply to her?

00:15:27.870 --> 00:15:30.080
I... I ran away.

00:15:30.080 --> 00:15:31.120
Huh?!

00:15:31.120 --> 00:15:34.830
Wait! It was just so much and I didn't understand,
and before I knew it-

00:15:34.830 --> 00:15:35.660
Idiot!

00:15:35.660 --> 00:15:40.160
You don't even think about how much courage it takes
to do that sort of thing, Tsutsui!

00:15:40.160 --> 00:15:41.500
You're the worst!

00:15:52.790 --> 00:15:54.700
Don't go to sleep there, okay?

00:15:56.080 --> 00:15:57.660
Hey, Ma...

00:15:57.660 --> 00:16:01.120
Is the fact that I'm bad with people genetic or something?

00:16:01.120 --> 00:16:05.660
That's rude. Both your father and I
have a relatively large amount of friends!

00:16:06.500 --> 00:16:12.410
I see. I really just wanted to blame someone for it,
but I guess it's my fault after all.

00:16:12.700 --> 00:16:17.080
Jeez, maybe I'll seriously become a recluse
before I cause everyone more trouble.

00:16:17.080 --> 00:16:18.790
I'm already heading straight into becoming a NEET.

00:16:18.790 --> 00:16:21.660
I have no time to provide for a NEET.

00:16:23.580 --> 00:16:28.700
Well, maybe none of them will ever smile at me again.

00:16:30.160 --> 00:16:31.620
What do I do?

00:16:38.830 --> 00:16:39.950
Ishino.

00:16:40.330 --> 00:16:42.080
Huh? What?

00:16:43.620 --> 00:16:45.700
Please... punch m-

00:16:50.120 --> 00:16:51.120
What?

00:16:51.120 --> 00:16:54.660
Well... I thought you might hesitate about this...

00:16:54.910 --> 00:16:56.080
What's this about?

00:16:56.080 --> 00:16:57.410
You ask me that AFTER you punch me?!

00:16:57.410 --> 00:16:58.500
So what?!

00:17:00.040 --> 00:17:01.830
Thanks, Ishino.

00:17:02.500 --> 00:17:12.080
Well, when I think about it, the only one who tells me
when something I do is bad and will punch me is you.

00:17:12.700 --> 00:17:16.830
I probably need that sort of thing. I'm grateful.

00:17:17.120 --> 00:17:19.410
Want me to do it again? An even better one...

00:17:19.410 --> 00:17:20.500
No, it's okay.

00:17:21.200 --> 00:17:25.870
I'm sorry I made our camping trip weird.
It was all my fault.

00:17:32.370 --> 00:17:34.660
We should show a bit more of our good sides.

00:17:35.200 --> 00:17:38.910
I mean, in my case, I really should
show a bit more of my girly side.

00:17:40.620 --> 00:17:41.500
Okay.

00:17:53.450 --> 00:17:56.410
It looks like there's something
I've gotta do, so I'll be right back!

00:18:00.290 --> 00:18:03.540
Huh? What are you doing over here?

00:18:03.830 --> 00:18:05.040
Oof.

00:18:05.910 --> 00:18:07.660
Why are you sitting here?

00:18:07.660 --> 00:18:10.750
We are good friends who went camping together.

00:18:10.750 --> 00:18:12.410
I don't remember becoming good friends.

00:18:12.660 --> 00:18:16.700
But I can't just leave.
Not while my friend has such a long face.

00:18:16.700 --> 00:18:18.080
It doesn't matter...

00:18:18.370 --> 00:18:19.750
Here, have a café au lait!

00:18:20.080 --> 00:18:21.040
I don't want it.

00:18:21.040 --> 00:18:23.660
C'mon, I have bread, too.

00:18:23.660 --> 00:18:24.500
No thanks.

00:18:27.620 --> 00:18:30.910
Tsutsui's the reason why you're making that face, right?

00:18:31.660 --> 00:18:33.950
He sure is stupid. For real.

00:18:33.950 --> 00:18:38.580
He sucks really bad at socializing. He's insensitive
and he can't see what's happening around him.

00:18:38.580 --> 00:18:41.450
He chooses to just worry about things
on his own then goes off in the wrong direction.

00:18:41.790 --> 00:18:44.870
Aren't you tired of that stuff, Igarashi? That type of gu-

00:18:44.870 --> 00:18:46.080
That isn't true!

00:18:50.080 --> 00:18:57.160
It's okay. That guy is going to think about you first,
even through all of that.

00:18:57.910 --> 00:19:00.120
He's not going to go anywhere.

00:19:00.120 --> 00:19:06.450
But you don't know that, do you?
I'm a pain in the ass. I'm always pushing people.

00:19:06.750 --> 00:19:11.580
Well, why don't you date a guy
that thinks that sort of thing is cute?

00:19:11.870 --> 00:19:16.000
You can think that since you have an abundance
of experience with other people.

00:19:16.000 --> 00:19:17.660
Tsutsun's different.

00:19:17.660 --> 00:19:18.910
Hold on, now...

00:19:18.910 --> 00:19:21.200
You're not exactly lacking in the
experience department either, you know.

00:19:21.750 --> 00:19:28.450
But this is my first time... wanting to trust someone
this much and yet not trusting them,

00:19:28.450 --> 00:19:30.950
I always end up not understanding myself.

00:19:32.200 --> 00:19:37.290
For Tsutsun, I think there must be a love where they
better understand each other that he can simply enjoy.

00:19:37.830 --> 00:19:43.370
I don't really know about games or anime... or Akiba...

00:19:43.370 --> 00:19:47.910
I think it's fine if you don't know about those.
Igarashi, you're getting too lost here.

00:19:50.080 --> 00:19:53.910
You should believe him.
You have to keep facing each other and talking.

00:19:54.370 --> 00:20:00.120
But why am I giving advice so seriously?
Is this Ishino's influence?

00:20:00.950 --> 00:20:03.950
Oh, but even if that doesn't work, I'm still here.

00:20:03.950 --> 00:20:07.330
I don't know how you have the nerve to say that, but no.

00:20:07.330 --> 00:20:08.370
Thanks.

00:20:08.370 --> 00:20:09.700
Wow, that's mean...

00:20:09.950 --> 00:20:12.500
No, really... Thank you.

00:20:15.790 --> 00:20:17.250
You're welcome.

00:20:28.040 --> 00:20:31.370
Inbox
Sender: Tsutsui-senpai
About your convession the other day

00:20:28.830 --> 00:20:31.120
About your confession the other day.

00:20:31.870 --> 00:20:35.790
Ayado, I'm sorry that I disappeared before.

00:20:36.410 --> 00:20:40.120
That was the first time that I was told
by someone that they like me,

00:20:40.120 --> 00:20:43.410
and before I knew it, my brain had overheated.

00:20:46.660 --> 00:20:52.120
I was hoping that a proper break up could ease
the ill feelings between you two at least a little.

00:20:55.330 --> 00:20:58.700
Ayado, you have a lot of courage.

00:20:55.370 --> 00:20:58.870
Ayado, you have
a lot of courage.

00:20:59.620 --> 00:21:05.410
I wonder what's good about a coward like me
that can't tell his girlfriend he loves her...

00:21:06.040 --> 00:21:09.830
And having to reject someone like her...

00:21:10.700 --> 00:21:13.250
That's a heavy burden.

00:21:15.370 --> 00:21:20.870
Inbox
Sender: Tsutsui-senpai
About your confession the other day
I want to reply tomorrow,
so please wait at your flower bed after school.

00:21:15.370 --> 00:21:20.870
Tsutsui

00:21:36.290 --> 00:21:40.750
Yume ga same sora nagamete omou
I wake from a dream and gaze at the sky

00:21:41.250 --> 00:21:46.080
Mune wo utsu ano kotoba kirei da
And think of those beautiful words that touched my heart

00:21:46.290 --> 00:21:50.450
Uwabe kazarazu hanasetara na...
If only I could talk to you without putting on airs...

00:21:51.000 --> 00:21:55.950
Sobietatsu fuan no tou ga
Is the pillar of fear towering above it all

00:21:57.330 --> 00:22:00.330
Ari no mama de ii no kana??
Okay just the way it is?

00:22:00.910 --> 00:22:05.580
Nan oku kounen nayameba ii no darou??
For how many millions of light-years must I suffer??

00:22:05.830 --> 00:22:08.750
Saa sugu doa akete
Come on, open the door now

00:22:08.910 --> 00:22:10.830
Ai ni yukou
And let's meet

00:22:10.830 --> 00:22:15.750
Imi nado nai yo hotondo ga
Most of it means nothing, you know

00:22:16.330 --> 00:22:20.250
Kimi ni sokkou de minukareru no osorete
The fear that you immediately see through me

00:22:20.950 --> 00:22:25.450
Koukai bakari da ne futari wa kitto
Fills me with regret, surely

00:22:25.450 --> 00:22:30.500
Zutto miageteta sora wa sotto
The sky that we always stared up at, quietly

00:22:30.500 --> 00:22:35.410
Bokura no asu wo terasu kitto
It will brighten our tomorrow, surely

00:22:35.830 --> 00:22:37.540
Kimi ni aitai desu
I want to see you

00:22:37.540 --> 00:22:40.040
Sugoku kantan na koto nan jan ne
That's not a super easy thing, right?

00:22:40.040 --> 00:22:42.790
Hora mijukumono
Hey, the inexperienced

00:22:42.790 --> 00:22:46.540
Seishun believer desu
Are believers in youth.
